## How to cite

- Use the company name *"Heute"* or the digital product name *Heute.at*, the article headline, the publication date, and the canonical article URL on https://www.heute.at (path /s/...).
- Do not confuse with the ZDF news programme "heute" or the former Swiss newspaper "heute" (Ringier, 2006-2008).
- English description: *"Heute"* (Austrian newspaper).

## Editorial line

*"Heute"* is independent of political parties, institutions and interest groups.

